  "content": "\n\n<h1>Immersive Optimization</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization\">\n<img alt=\"GitHub\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>一个实体刻调度器，可大幅减少实体卡顿（约提升200%运行速度）及其资源消耗。</p>\n\n<p>与类似模组不同，本模组不会完全禁用刻更新，从而允许农场或远处的实体继续正常运行。</p>\n\n<p>与 Entity Culling（实体剔除）搭配使用效果极佳。</p>\n\n<h2>Discord</h2>\n\n<p>\n尽管经过充分测试，但仍可能存在一些不完善之处。如有问题，请在\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveOptimization/issues\">GitHub</a> 或\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">Discord</a> 上反馈。\n</p>\n\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>逐步降低实体和方块实体的刻率</li>\n<li>将更新分散到多个刻中，以平滑卡顿峰值</li>\n<li>根据服务器负载动态调整刻率</li>\n<li>配置命令 (<code>/io ...</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>已测试的整合包</h2>\n\n<p>具体数值会因情况而异，但我观察到：</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Cobblemon 1.20.1 Fabric 版本性能提升约150%</li>\n<li>在包含约700个模组的私人整合包中（画廊示例），性能提升约330%</li>\n</ul>\n\n<img width=\"547\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=547,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/screenshots/speed.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>Immersive Collection</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=大量独特且忠实原版风格的护甲套装。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=一系列复古飞机，用于旅行、运输和探索！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=在各种乐器上演奏自定义旋律，烦死你的朋友！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=拖放、像素化并悬挂精美艺术品。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=轻量级实体刻调度器，让你的TPS翻倍。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=在非必要时隐藏丑陋的方块选中框轮廓。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=专为配合 Create 模组设计的额外飞机套装，适用于 Immersive Aircraft。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=一系列复古机械，用于运输、开采和自动化生产。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=在游戏中创建自定义和精美的家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=散布在主世界各处的神秘远古传送门。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=4bc421a55085304de2fccf0ca474a559\" alt=\"便于页面部署的页面哈希值。\"/>",
